    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "To associate marker groups with an asset for playback, use the [`navigationMarkerGroups`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVPlayerItem/navigationMarkerGroups) property of an [`AVPlayerItem`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVPlayerItem) object.",
      "ko": "재생할 자산에 마커 그룹을 연결하려면 [`AVPlayerItem`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVPlayerItem) 객체의 [`navigationMarkerGroups`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVPlayerItem/navigationMarkerGroups) 속성을 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "77c92168e42bd308dce5030befd73d16f54dd751329c857a52bd8665d91be9c5",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "To create a chapter list, pass `nil` for the `title` parameter and set the group as the first item in the player item’s [`navigationMarkerGroups`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVPlayerItem/navigationMarkerGroups) array.",
      "ko": "To create a chapter list, pass `nil` for the `title` parameter and set the group as the first item in the player item’s [`navigationMarkerGroups`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/AVFoundation/AVPlayerItem/navigationMarkerGroups) array.",
      "sourceHash": "fe10122b34ab19b3e938d0d6a547854d1e491a351de7e51b6c30752fcfe5db7a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "To provide additional options for navigating media (such as a “Goals Scored” group for a recorded sporting event), provide a unique `title` value for each marker group in the array.",
      "ko": "미디어 탐색을 위한 추가 옵션(예: 녹화 스포츠 이벤트의 “Goals Scored” 그룹)을 제공하려면 배열의 각 마커 그룹에 고유한 `title` 값을 지정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "77a9c2da3dd467159ce1878c17873412a145409ee3ab89f0eb6645c8d362b4b4",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
